# Commit

Use [Conventional Commits](https://www.conventionalcommits.org/) — see `.claude/skills/commit/SKILL.md`.

## CHANGELOG

**Do not** edit `CHANGELOG.md` when committing unless the user also asks to **更新记录** in the same request.

When the user says **更新记录** / **update changelog**, follow `.cursor/rules/update-changelog.mdc` and `.claude/skills/update-changelog/SKILL.md`.
